# UI Components

- shadcn primitives live in `src/components/ui` — do not fork without reason.
- Feature UI: `src/components/modules/{module}/`. Shared: `src/components/shared`, layout: `src/components/layout`.
- Keep business logic out of components; use Server Actions + props.
- Reuse `PageHeader`, `DataTableShell`, `ModulePlaceholder` patterns before adding new shells.
- Client components only when needed (forms, tables, filters).
